{"id":"en_beauty-meets-destiny","title":"Beauty Meets Destiny","titleEn":"Beauty Meets Destiny","description":"York Yonder came down from the mountain carrying marriage contracts arranged by his masters. One of them had picked out an ordinary, unassuming wife for him, while the rest selected women of the highest caliber. On his journey he rescued Queenie Morgan from an ambush, and later treated her father Todd, who hoped to match him with Queenie. Along the way, York also crossed paths with Lily Sorkin and Francis Lorne. Those interested can follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/beauty-meets-destiny/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/beauty-meets-destiny/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Immortal Fantasy","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjoo2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_beauty-meets-destiny_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjoo2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_beauty-meets-destiny_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjoo2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_beauty-meets-destiny_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjoo2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_beauty-meets-destiny_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjoo2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_beauty-meets-destiny_5","title":"Episode 5","seaso